{"id":"P036-1","subject":"P","unit":"P036","unitTitle":"2024 상반기 · 24.05.18 부산교통공사 (운전직) (사람인)","set":1,"questions":[{"id":"P036-S1-Q01","number":1,"question":"24.05.18 부산교통공사 (운전직) (사람인) · 객관식 1번","searchText":" 01\n\n3C의 정전하가 (, , )의 위치에, 9C의 정전하가\n(, , )의 위치에 있을 때, 원점에서의 전위의 크기는\n\n몇 V인가?\n\n             ①    ×      ②    ×    \n\n                                       ③                  ④ ×    ×","source":{"collection":"2024h1","collectionLabel":"2024 상반기","examLabel":"24.05.18 부산교통공사 (운전직) (사람인)","originalId":"2024h1-e15-m01","number":1},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h1-e15-m01-q.webp","width":678,"height":636},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h1-e15-m01-e1.webp","width":678,"height":1498}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P036-S1-Q02","number":2,"question":"24.05.18 부산교통공사 (운전직) (사람인) · 객관식 2번","searchText":" 02\n\n인덕턴스가 1mH인 코일에 × J의 자기에너지가\n축적되기 위해 흘려주어야 할 전류 A 는?\n\n\n① 1           ② 2\n\n③ 3           ④ 4","source":{"collection":"2024h1","collectionLabel":"2024 상반기","examLabel":"24.05.18 부산교통공사 (운전직) (사람인)","originalId":"2024h1-e15-m02","number":2},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h1-e15-m02-q.webp","width":678,"height":528},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h1-e15-m02-e1.webp","width":696,"height":827}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P036-S1-Q03","number":3,"question":"24.05.18 부산교통공사 (운전직) (사람인) · 객관식 3번","searchText":" 03\n\n공기중에 존재하는 +1C의 전하를 원점으로부터 4m\n\n떨어진 위치에서 2m 떨어진 위치로 이동시키는 경우에\n\n한 일의 양J은?\n\n\n                             \n①            ②         \n\n                           \n③           ④ ","source":{"collection":"2024h1","collectionLabel":"2024 상반기","examLabel":"24.05.18 부산교통공사 (운전직) (사람인)","originalId":"2024h1-e15-m03","number":3},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h1-e15-m03-q.webp","width":678,"height":570},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h1-e15-m03-e1.webp","width":696,"height":1028}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P036-S1-Q04","number":4,"question":"24.05.18 부산교통공사 (운전직) (사람인) · 객관식 4번","searchText":" 04\n\n주파수 20MHz의 평면 전자기파가 도전율이 ×                                                \nm, 투자율이 × Hm인 도체에 작용할 때\n\n표피효과가 발생한다. 이 때, 표피효과의 저항비는?\n\n\n                        \n①            ②      \n\n③         ④ ","source":{"collection":"2024h1","collectionLabel":"2024 상반기","examLabel":"24.05.18 부산교통공사 (운전직) (사람인)","originalId":"2024h1-e15-m04","number":4},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h1-e15-m04-q.webp","width":696,"height":630},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h1-e15-m04-e1.webp","width":678,"height":1881}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":true,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P036-S1-Q05","number":5,"question":"24.05.18 부산교통공사 (운전직) (사람인) · 객관식 5번","searchText":" 05\n\n                                    \n전송선로에서 전압파의 반사계수가     일 때, 정재파                                            \n\n비는?\n\n\n        \n①             ②        \n\n        \n③             ④        ","source":{"collection":"2024h1","collectionLabel":"2024 상반기","examLabel":"24.05.18 부산교통공사 (운전직) (사람인)","originalId":"2024h1-e15-m05","number":5},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h1-e15-m05-q.webp","width":696,"height":667},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h1-e15-m05-e1.webp","width":696,"height":1881}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":true,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P036-S1-Q06","number":6,"question":"24.05.18 부산교통공사 (운전직) (사람인) · 객관식 6번","searchText":" 06\n\n정전용량이 2F인 콘덴서 와 4F인 콘덴서 를 병\n렬로 연결한 회로에 36C의 전하를 공급하였다.\n\n이 때, 2F의 콘덴서 에 저장되는 에너지J는?\n\n\n① 12          ② 24\n\n③ 36          ④ 48","source":{"collection":"2024h1","collectionLabel":"2024 상반기","examLabel":"24.05.18 부산교통공사 (운전직) (사람인)","originalId":"2024h1-e15-m06","number":6},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h1-e15-m06-q.webp","width":696,"height":579},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h1-e15-m06-e1.webp","width":678,"height":1114}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P036-S1-Q07","number":7,"question":"24.05.18 부산교통공사 (운전직) (사람인) · 객관식 7번","searchText":" 07\n\n자유공간상에서 전파되는 평면파의 전계가 2Vm일 때,\n평면파의 전력밀도Wm는?\n\n\n                            \n①            ②      \n\n                             \n③            ④     ","source":{"collection":"2024h1","collectionLabel":"2024 상반기","examLabel":"24.05.18 부산교통공사 (운전직) (사람인)","originalId":"2024h1-e15-m07","number":7},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h1-e15-m07-q.webp","width":678,"height":630},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h1-e15-m07-e1.webp","width":678,"height":768}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P036-S1-Q08","number":8,"question":"24.05.18 부산교통공사 (운전직) (사람인) · 객관식 8번","searchText":" 08\n\n3상 3선식 송전선로가 소도체 2개의 복도체 방식으로 되\n\n어 있을 때, 소도체의 지름이 16cm, 소도체 간격이 18\n\ncm, 등가선간거리가 240cm인 경우에 복도체 1km당\n\n의 작용 인덕턴스는 약 몇 mH 인가?\n(단, log, log이다,)\n\n\n① 0.382             ② 0.4823\n\n③ 0.541             ④ 0.624","source":{"collection":"2024h1","collectionLabel":"2024 상반기","examLabel":"24.05.18 부산교통공사 (운전직) (사람인)","originalId":"2024h1-e15-m08","number":8},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h1-e15-m08-q.webp","width":678,"height":683},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h1-e15-m08-e1.webp","width":696,"height":1881}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":true,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P036-S1-Q09","number":9,"question":"24.05.18 부산교통공사 (운전직) (사람인) · 객관식 9번","searchText":" 09\n\n어떤 수용가의 일 평균사용 전력량이 720kWh이고, 최대\n\n사용전력이 50kW일 때, 수용가의 부하율은 몇 인가?\n\n\n① 50          ② 55\n\n③ 60          ④ 65","source":{"collection":"2024h1","collectionLabel":"2024 상반기","examLabel":"24.05.18 부산교통공사 (운전직) (사람인)","originalId":"2024h1-e15-m09","number":9},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h1-e15-m09-q.webp","width":678,"height":567},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h1-e15-m09-e1.webp","width":678,"height":1881}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P036-S1-Q10","number":10,"question":"24.05.18 부산교통공사 (운전직) (사람인) · 객관식 10번","searchText":" 10\n\n다음 내용의 빈칸에 들어갈 가장 알맞은 말은?\n\n 고속도재폐로는 가공선로에 고장이 발생하면 순시적으\n\n 로 우선 차단을 하고, 일정시간 후 다시 재투입하는 것\n\n 으로, (           )을 위해 채용한다.\n\n\n\n① 발전기 보호      ② 변압기 보호\n\n③ 고속도전압 억제    ④ 안정도 증진","source":{"collection":"2024h1","collectionLabel":"2024 상반기","examLabel":"24.05.18 부산교통공사 (운전직) (사람인)","originalId":"2024h1-e15-m10","number":10},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h1-e15-m10-q.webp","width":696,"height":634},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h1-e15-m10-e1.webp","width":696,"height":1881}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":true,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P036-S1-Q11","number":11,"question":"24.05.18 부산교통공사 (운전직) (사람인) · 객관식 11번","searchText":" 11\n\n역률 0.8, 100kW의 부하를 3상 3선식 배전선로에 접속\n\n하였을 때 수전단 전압이 2500V였다. 배전선 1조의 저\n\n항이 5Ω, 리액턴스가 4Ω일 경우, 송전단 전압은 몇\n\nV인가?\n\n\n① 2820.0        ② 2913.2\n\n③ 3054.3        ④ 3215.6","source":{"collection":"2024h1","collectionLabel":"2024 상반기","examLabel":"24.05.18 부산교통공사 (운전직) (사람인)","originalId":"2024h1-e15-m11","number":11},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h1-e15-m11-q.webp","width":696,"height":643},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h1-e15-m11-e1.webp","width":678,"height":1201}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P036-S1-Q12","number":12,"question":"24.05.18 부산교통공사 (운전직) (사람인) · 객관식 12번","searchText":" 12\n\n3상 200kW, 역률 0.8의 배전선로 말단에 콘덴서를 병\n\n렬로 접속하여 역률을 1로 만들려고 할 때, 필요한 콘덴서\n\n의 용량은 몇 kVA 인가?\n\n\n① 100         ② 120\n\n③ 150         ④ 180","source":{"collection":"2024h1","collectionLabel":"2024 상반기","examLabel":"24.05.18 부산교통공사 (운전직) (사람인)","originalId":"2024h1-e15-m12","number":12},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h1-e15-m12-q.webp","width":696,"height":603},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h1-e15-m12-e1.webp","width":678,"height":681}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P036-S1-Q13","number":13,"question":"24.05.18 부산교통공사 (운전직) (사람인) · 객관식 13번","searchText":" 13\n\n다음은 변압기의 효율에 대한 설명이다. 제시문의 괄호 안\n\n에 알맞은 것은?\n\n 변압기의 전일효율을 높이기 위해 철손의 비중을 적게\n 해야하며, 부하율이 인 경우에 전일효율은 철손이         \n\n 동손의 (   )배일 때 최대가 된다.\n\n\n\n①           ② \n\n                           \n③           ④ ","source":{"collection":"2024h1","collectionLabel":"2024 상반기","examLabel":"24.05.18 부산교통공사 (운전직) (사람인)","originalId":"2024h1-e15-m13","number":13},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h1-e15-m13-q.webp","width":678,"height":677},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h1-e15-m13-e1.webp","width":696,"height":1881}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":true,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P036-S1-Q14","number":14,"question":"24.05.18 부산교통공사 (운전직) (사람인) · 객관식 14번","searchText":" 14\n\n다음과 같은 조건의 직류 분권발전기가 무부하 상태에서\n\n정격속도로 회전할 때, 발전기의 유도기전력은 몇 V\n\n인가?\n\n 계자저항 60Ω, 계자전류 2A , 전기자저항 1Ω\n\n\n\n① 122         ② 125\n\n③ 128         ④ 130","source":{"collection":"2024h1","collectionLabel":"2024 상반기","examLabel":"24.05.18 부산교통공사 (운전직) (사람인)","originalId":"2024h1-e15-m14","number":14},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h1-e15-m14-q.webp","width":678,"height":605},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h1-e15-m14-e1.webp","width":678,"height":1881}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P036-S1-Q15","number":15,"question":"24.05.18 부산교통공사 (운전직) (사람인) · 객관식 15번","searchText":" 15\n\n다음 내용의 빈칸에 들어갈 가장 알맞은 말은?\n\n 동기발전기의 전기자 전류의 위상이 유도기전력보다\n\n 90° 늦으면 ( ⓐ )작용이, 동기전동기의 전기자 전류\n\n 의 위상이 유도기전력보다 90° 늦으면 ( ⓑ )작용이\n\n 발생한다.\n\n\n         ⓐ           ⓑ\n\n ①      증자          증자\n\n ②      감자          증자\n\n ③      감자          감자\n\n ④      증자          감자","source":{"collection":"2024h1","collectionLabel":"2024 상반기","examLabel":"24.05.18 부산교통공사 (운전직) (사람인)","originalId":"2024h1-e15-m15","number":15},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h1-e15-m15-q.webp","width":678,"height":598},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h1-e15-m15-e1.webp","width":696,"height":977}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P036-S1-Q16","number":16,"question":"24.05.18 부산교통공사 (운전직) (사람인) · 객관식 16번","searchText":" 16\n\n3상 유도전동기의 1차 입력이 50kW, 1차 손실이 2kW,\n\n슬립이 0.08일 때, 기계적 출력은 약 몇 kW인가?\n\n\n① 42          ② 44\n\n③ 46          ④ 48","source":{"collection":"2024h1","collectionLabel":"2024 상반기","examLabel":"24.05.18 부산교통공사 (운전직) (사람인)","originalId":"2024h1-e15-m16","number":16},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h1-e15-m16-q.webp","width":696,"height":523},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h1-e15-m16-e1.webp","width":696,"height":905}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P036-S1-Q17","number":17,"question":"24.05.18 부산교통공사 (운전직) (사람인) · 객관식 17번","searchText":" 17\n\n6상 회전변류기의 정격출력이 3000kW, 직류측 정격전\n\n압이 1000V일 때, 교류측 입력 전류의 크기는 몇 A \n\n인가? (단, 역률과 효율은 모두 100이다.)\n\n①        ② \n\n③           ④ ","source":{"collection":"2024h1","collectionLabel":"2024 상반기","examLabel":"24.05.18 부산교통공사 (운전직) (사람인)","originalId":"2024h1-e15-m17","number":17},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h1-e15-m17-q.webp","width":696,"height":567},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h1-e15-m17-e1.webp","width":678,"height":1881}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P036-S1-Q18","number":18,"question":"24.05.18 부산교통공사 (운전직) (사람인) · 객관식 18번","searchText":" 18\n\n다음과 같은 회로에서 1Ω에 걸리는 전압 V는?\n\n\n\n\n\n① -40          ② -75\n\n③ 40          ④ 75","source":{"collection":"2024h1","collectionLabel":"2024 상반기","examLabel":"24.05.18 부산교통공사 (운전직) (사람인)","originalId":"2024h1-e15-m18","number":18},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h1-e15-m18-q.webp","width":696,"height":790},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h1-e15-m18-e1.webp","width":696,"height":1881}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P036-S1-Q19","number":19,"question":"24.05.18 부산교통공사 (운전직) (사람인) · 객관식 19번","searchText":" 19\n\n다음과 같은 회로에서 부하에 최대 전력이 전달되도록\n\n하기 위한 은 몇 H 인가?\n\n\n\n\n\n① 0.25         ② 0.5\n\n③ 0.75             ④ 1.0","source":{"collection":"2024h1","collectionLabel":"2024 상반기","examLabel":"24.05.18 부산교통공사 (운전직) (사람인)","originalId":"2024h1-e15-m19","number":19},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h1-e15-m19-q.webp","width":678,"height":1000},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h1-e15-m19-e1.webp","width":678,"height":1881},{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h1-e15-m19-e2.webp","width":696,"height":1883}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P036-S1-Q20","number":20,"question":"24.05.18 부산교통공사 (운전직) (사람인) · 객관식 20번","searchText":" 20\n\n다음과 같은 회로에서 일 때, 스위치가 에 접속되어\n\n직류 전류가 흐르다가 일 때 스위치가 에 접속되었\n\n다. 이 때, 1k Ω의 저항에 흐르는 전류는 몇 A인가?\n\n\n\n\n\n①        ② \n③        ④ ","source":{"collection":"2024h1","collectionLabel":"2024 상반기","examLabel":"24.05.18 부산교통공사 (운전직) (사람인)","originalId":"2024h1-e15-m20","number":20},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h1-e15-m20-q.webp","width":678,"height":879},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h1-e15-m20-e1.webp","width":678,"height":1881}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":true,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P036-S1-Q21","number":21,"question":"24.05.18 부산교통공사 (운전직) (사람인) · 객관식 21번","searchText":" 21\n\n\n그림의 회로에 대한 등가 임피던스 의 설명으로 올바른\n\n것은? (단, 각속도는 rads이다.)\n\n\n\n\n\n① 등가 임피던스는 저항 1Ω으로 구성된다.\n\n② 등가 임피던스는 커패시터 1F로 구성된다.\n\n③ 등가 임피던스는 저항 1Ω과 코일 1H 의 직렬 임피\n\n  던스이다.\n\n④ 등가 임피던스는 저항1Ω 과 커패시터 1F의 직렬\n\n  임피던스이다.","source":{"collection":"2024h1","collectionLabel":"2024 상반기","examLabel":"24.05.18 부산교통공사 (운전직) (사람인)","originalId":"2024h1-e15-m21","number":21},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h1-e15-m21-q.webp","width":696,"height":1003},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h1-e15-m21-e1.webp","width":696,"height":1881}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P036-S1-Q22","number":22,"question":"24.05.18 부산교통공사 (운전직) (사람인) · 객관식 22번","searchText":" 22\n\n다음과 같은 회로에서 3Ω의 저항에 흐르는 전류 는\n\n약 몇 A 인가?\n\n\n\n\n\n① 121.1         ② 134.3\n\n③ 142.6        ④ 151.4\n\n⑤ 167.7","source":{"collection":"2024h1","collectionLabel":"2024 상반기","examLabel":"24.05.18 부산교통공사 (운전직) (사람인)","originalId":"2024h1-e15-m22","number":22},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h1-e15-m22-q.webp","width":696,"height":876},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h1-e15-m22-e1.webp","width":678,"height":1881}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation"